            ^"Activities in the last 3 years" STRING "Tolides spent three seasons developing his greatest achievement, the spell Domain of Darkness. Spending almost an entire three years in his lab, he learned another True Name of a demon, and fine-tuned his battery of spells to stand prepared against the continuous threat of being discovered and slain by the Hoplites of the Order."
